at 20 153 0) (effects (font (size 1.52 1.52)) (justify left top)) (uuid a7273a90-40f1-5d87-be83-0d0144d6ccb8)) (text "1. One cell is one-sixth of the future 220 A RMS module: about 51.9 A peak with ideal sinusoidal sharing." (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 80064c86-b468-5b2a-8ede-29b35610f254)) (text "2. QH1 / QL1 symbol exposes every package pad: 1 gate; 2,4,6 source; 3,5,7 drain. No separate Kelvin package pin." (at 20 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 1a3983ae-7d88-539a-89d9-e5f77044fd8b)) (text "3. Gate return must take off at the source pad nearest the gate; copper geometry defines Kelvin performance." (at 20 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid f60392c1-c31b-5ff8-b674-3cf24dc205db)) (text "4. Cold plate contacts the source-connected FET tops through insulating TIM. Driver circuitry is external." (at 20 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 39c01ac8-e7ce-5a16-83fd-5f1886641309)) (text "5. Port pads and driver pads are interface placeholders, not selected/rated connectors. RG values require driver tuning." (at 20 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 62e0e736-ecef-5c92-904d-193c1e9fb22c)) (text "6. Verify VDS overshoot, capacitance bias/ripple, current sharing, coolant conditions and completed routing before release." (at 20 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 8a92ce68-7985-5a75-b6db-a9babcdbf145)))